# Text Compression Tool using Huffman Coding

A Java console application that uses **Huffman Coding** for lossless text compression and decompression.

## Features
- Compress text into binary codes
- Display the Huffman code table
- Decode encoded text
- Show compression savings
- Handle empty and invalid input

## Technologies
- Java
- HashMap
- PriorityQueue
- Huffman Tree
- Recursion

## Run
```bash
javac TextCompressionTool.java
java TextCompressionTool
